[{"comment_id": "7659789439573787441", "create_time": 1783433707, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "千年文化啊，被误解成日本的。希望被更多人了解认识", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "200", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAM72oQMgod--fTDTLyesK4t4X9hG-7jkwrJk9qUwL_Z4", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAM72oQMgod--fTDTLyesK4t4X9hG-7jkwrJk9qUwL_Z4", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "33479612694", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "用户5161030688348", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/aweme_default_avatar.png.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "5", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7659789811843564298", "create_time": 1783433794, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "小时候我阿公就一直在穿木屐，远远听见木屐走路咯咯响的声音就知道是阿公回来了，如今阿公的模样已经在我脑海中渐渐模糊了…看到这个视频又想起小时候阿公穿着木屐牵着我的手的画面…[流泪]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "314", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAaF3_PS5K-mV6XOxLYE9zcVI6eSOAzNH6vdym32mA58g", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAaF3_PS5K-mV6XOxLYE9zcVI6eSOAzNH6vdym32mA58g", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "278961522", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "Zzz彗子", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_58cc25d8fb44bcd7f17299d2f13288b3.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "4", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7660205138049565440", "create_time": 1783530497, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "“文化终究不是冰冷的所有权，而是流动的生命力” 这句话说的太好了！ 我看到弹幕中很多人很激进的评价日本偷了我们的东西 但实则不然 木屐传入日本后也经历了改良和发扬 导致很多人知道木屐可能是因为日本 相反木屐在国内却没有得到很多重视 我想九月的视频也是呼吁大家能够珍惜我们自己的文化 不断创新和完善 不是为了引起民族对立", "is_author_digged": true, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "851", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAATMNwxnOHqHwM_vLWqO434bWdgIQGVcYICD_PS6Lvidk", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAATMNwxnOHqHwM_vLWqO434bWdgIQGVcYICD_PS6Lvidk", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "nuonuo102852", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "小赵就是小赵", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_44b32a4a590bee9619f884b106024b87.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "7", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7659801759421924137", "create_time": 1783436575, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "中国把它遗忘了，日本把它传承下来了，是谁的问题！", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "223", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAwL6cIq_rALDXCohLu7wByq_hqTSz4ZDwhogVlyjX7Dco3aqK3dBwrk3S6bq_l5RH", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAwL6cIq_rALDXCohLu7wByq_hqTSz4ZDwhogVlyjX7Dco3aqK3dBwrk3S6bq_l5RH", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "56964636975", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "陈林家丫头", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/aweme_default_avatar.png.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "14", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7659790026825810737", "create_time": 1783433843, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "其实这个视频里不止是木屐被日本学走了，还有漆器也是[流泪]大漆的工艺现在也是日本更好、国内做漆器的人好多时候也是买的日本漆", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "537", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAcqtN7xoijGfG8fUUmF_b9MT4By4VKmPBg7eV6ibZ51o", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAcqtN7xoijGfG8fUUmF_b9MT4By4VKmPBg7eV6ibZ51o", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "xxq.NGC2237", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "是阿玊呀～", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_okeqDfs9BE2EI7hyFANAFESUEG7QAA2eDB3ASh.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "7", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7659792299590042417", "create_time": 1783434372, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "“脚著谢公屐，身登青云梯”，太多自己不在意的东西，都被别人给发扬了", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "724", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAum6tof35thiK9vn0O-Uhf3w8nNMX9RCbZiMfY_5PIdM", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAum6tof35thiK9vn0O-Uhf3w8nNMX9RCbZiMfY_5PIdM", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "ZJL870504", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "张漂亮", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_786cbf9212ae6b1fda0059286d843f09.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "14", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7659823383929455398", "create_time": 1783441613, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "中国真的很需要加强文化宣传啊 很多人认为木屐是日本的，可能因为日本对文化宣传这方面真的蛮上心的 然后呢，木屐在他们那里出现频率太高，而我们国家的文物及非遗种类太多了，又不受重视", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "539", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAgqd96eErvh-8VV0-ItdFRONQIQeckcHhFlHKsz87cxX2mQCVnQY6IBAsRl6TVZmA", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAgqd96eErvh-8VV0-ItdFRONQIQeckcHhFlHKsz87cxX2mQCVnQY6IBAsRl6TVZmA", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "52739819246", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "杆式破碎", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_ad4a1861c5faa6d8865b42dea730c1c2.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "8", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7660006035024855857", "create_time": 1783484136, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "脚著谢公屐，身登青云梯——梦游天姥吟留别", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "256", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA-TTOEg4NxaVbnKMRl_RDs6AAexZxM7J1HCdiUzuO5cEKpVJ1mnPHvTyAdfchVQNE", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA-TTOEg4NxaVbnKMRl_RDs6AAexZxM7J1HCdiUzuO5cEKpVJ1mnPHvTyAdfchVQNE", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "58160797613", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "虞茗锦Smile", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_owE9GzQh9G2NAODzCwfKFAAnA6IIpASUEP0pfA.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "1", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7659801031228588863", "create_time": 1783436406, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "大家好，我是梁锦泉老师的儿子梁茶，九月真的是一个能量好高的人！被她感染到了，我们会继续好好做下去，谢谢大家的鼓励和支持！", "is_author_digged": true, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "25883", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAoOqRjSh5C1lX4dH3ISeuoDq74qWcf-0ISlSwtjafWsfSNoIX8uKQcgnxddfTjIAF", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAoOqRjSh5C1lX4dH3ISeuoDq74qWcf-0ISlSwtjafWsfSNoIX8uKQcgnxddfTjIAF", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "23766218289", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "东莞锦屐", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_3b553e0940d748c097eadd93c8bc06bf.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "179", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7660135176118289210", "create_time": 1783514204, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "我们的文化被掠夺了，没有传承，这样年轻一代的人都遗忘了，只有老的一代还记得这些东西！在我小时候我爷爷也给我们做过木屐穿，走起路哒哒哒的！那时候很多人嘲笑穿日本鞋，结果是我们中国的[流泪]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "42", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAqjYBzUBcX2lj1VcV1Rmbp_sh-OVyb55nMMzFvhkYeL0", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAqjYBzUBcX2lj1VcV1Rmbp_sh-OVyb55nMMzFvhkYeL0", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "52460631", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "Lin＞g⊃林", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_oQO7MQgfQQRAJiB3gEeAn8WAS3kevJ8rUUAJ9z.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7659807038956487461", "create_time": 1783437804, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "日本本来很多东西都是我们中国我们华夏民族，如他们每天都喝的味增刺身甚至乌冬面拉面都是起源于中国！！！历史不能遗忘，传承不能忘，被传出去的更不能遗忘发源地更不能让所在的国家硬生生通过日常悄然把我们的文化变成是他们的！！更加不能让传承断在我们手上！！！", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "86", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAhBnG_XdGGf_gU5ImHE7Q3RvgLdlzbObFFm2tkeXLzwc", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAhBnG_XdGGf_gU5ImHE7Q3RvgLdlzbObFFm2tkeXLzwc", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "dykbtqvrgnoh", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "寻一", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_o8pAnDiz3EBEg5AAeWAwfjispOIF9KIEnA0ojC.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "7", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7663333621420376866", "create_time": 1784258904, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "本来日本的就是中国传过去的啊[泪奔] 以前古人下雨天穿木屐防脚湿，还有古诗词里也有提到过穿屐的……看到评论区很多人说周围的人都不信中国自古就有木屐，我真是觉得很悲哀啊，小学语文和中学历史，或者说看古装电视剧都不认真吗[无语流汗]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "8", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAsmlecHDFSZcY_wvUgo-SXlRzMucCGTB7iJaijSho-t8", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAsmlecHDFSZcY_wvUgo-SXlRzMucCGTB7iJaijSho-t8", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "1841506359", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "小依小瑞🍎", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_8666f2a069784ac6398336b6e3ca5a32.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7660094975930270516", "create_time": 1783504845, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "看到弹幕说我们文化传承不好，木屐是被时代淘汰的产物，真的很难过！[抱紧自己]这是那个时代不得不像放下的事情，在百年屈辱的历史里好不容易走出来，急需的是高速发展，就像视频里说一双木屐制作达到一年时长之久，可见并不适合当时的高速发展的要求，手工的既要高产又要便宜，显然很少东西可以达到这个要求，潮汕为什么能传承下了，我觉得最大的原因不是有多重视，而是和某个东西绑定在一起，甚至可以说，就不是重视！是把这些融入到日常生活去了，比如成年礼对子辈的祝福才传承下了，日本我不清楚但是看图片也知道他们把木屐和和服搭配在一起，也是成人礼，都快成刻板印象了，一说和服就想到日本，有多少人会想到这是起源于中国魏晋，传承与普及两手抓，我永远支持九月的非遗传承，她让更多人知道了这个非遗，还在我们现在已经在寻根了\n手艺人为了讨生活往别处发展了，所以能一直坚持的人才难能可贵啊，也不要是我们为什么没传承下了，塑料鞋量大便宜本来就容易冲击原来的商品，有个弹幕说的特别好，“可以和文旅妆造那些合作”，现在不应该抱怨，而是一起想办法献计策为非遗找和时代一起发展的出路呀！对不对！\n\n还有日本没申遗成功爽爆了[激情开麦]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "47", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAz-vl-VgXPpIB9wldPnXOCMHohn6wYRk1vePLJ8qZq3o", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAz-vl-VgXPpIB9wldPnXOCMHohn6wYRk1vePLJ8qZq3o", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "0123_0715", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "镕铃", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_oMqEVLIKAB3CoCrUILiAg6IieAy0AjufAAC0Am.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7661517359505392436", "create_time": 1783836020, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "木屐和抹茶确实都是我们的 日本当时来学 然后带回去了 但后面是我们自己放弃的…………因为带来的经济价值有限 就被抛弃了……所以理性看待吧 自己的东西自己先重视 不然也确实没有怪别人学了且坚持发扬的立场……", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "45", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAzdzUsww0gEtZbocvLs9SoCsTsR23Ej5ytYkS9XM7hXU", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAzdzUsww0gEtZbocvLs9SoCsTsR23Ej5ytYkS9XM7hXU", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "181537977", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "80岁的少女", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_b2faa2eab777473e90f79d7b25cbf2f6.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "6", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7660103521618379569", "create_time": 1783506834, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "因为《梦游天姥吟留别》的“脚著谢公屐，身登青云梯。”让我知道了中国文化", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "74", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA9CL4r8DuCtKziPg5w90JZ0THHm8_hcVaRGWelo3TxsMe8VRkSyGB9o8AtNSxUZ4U", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA9CL4r8DuCtKziPg5w90JZ0THHm8_hcVaRGWelo3TxsMe8VRkSyGB9o8AtNSxUZ4U", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "gj8886660910", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "爱生活的小黑球", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_02b8a30cb573d0b44f09f9962e9cc486.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "1", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7661282992648815396", "create_time": 1783781451, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "日韩哪有什么文明，往上追溯会发现几乎都来自于华夏文明，然后在他们那里一代又一代的衍生，过程中必然会产生变化，但起源来自于华夏文明这一点，我个人觉得不用有任何怀疑。最难过的是，我们可能真的经历了一场撕心裂肺的文明断代，虽然我们都是中国人，但却已经不是华夏文明的传承者了[流泪]，老祖宗们会觉得我们很没用吧[泣不成声]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "25", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA5RGksnISQy6tCqsVmgACTD_qlF5BwuX1HUJRORgWvm4", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA5RGksnISQy6tCqsVmgACTD_qlF5BwuX1HUJRORgWvm4", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "1230105605", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "老干妈顶呱呱", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/a161001e8d6ebbfde2fc.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7660523565557957419", "create_time": 1783604633, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "朱然墓出土了一双木屐，证明早在三国时期就有木屐了，粉碎了日本关于自己是木屐发源地的说法，现在这双木屐就躺在朱然家族墓地博物馆里，是我国195件不可出境的文物之一", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "19", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAArt06c6p18huIrP579NgtZDBMA0oWQIUbFXyqsj1yIkYn0fAk5RGZAu3DsSeZsiYX", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAArt06c6p18huIrP579NgtZDBMA0oWQIUbFXyqsj1yIkYn0fAk5RGZAu3DsSeZsiYX", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "qingren44068", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "夏之末末", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_726e75d6550909db8992c626a8d9d555.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7660565661865231150", "create_time": 1783614436, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "日本的很多文化都是从中国就传过去了，记得小时候我们都有穿过，拿轮胎钉上去的小时候叫板鞋因为是木板做的，茶艺也是从中国传过去的，别人把我们国家的文化拿去用得很深厚，我们确把中华文化给丢失了，近几年才开始重视[微笑]", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "44", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAJQoQV3pbSrJ5tRKTVGz4jyf1mWYEf2SPCd8F1lKGzag", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAJQoQV3pbSrJ5tRKTVGz4jyf1mWYEf2SPCd8F1lKGzag", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "Weimeiyoga666", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "观禾", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_oAPl57AfvIAeWAZrAEAZgXQKefDPrICIJGO2yL.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "4", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7667798547127501595", "create_time": 1785298473, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "东晋：“谢公屐”的智慧\n相传由诗人谢灵运发明，是古代的专业登山装备。其核心设计是可拆卸的前后齿，上山时去掉前齿，下山时去掉后齿，实现如履平地。\n \n 三国：朱然墓的铁证\n日本曾试图为木屐申请非遗，但因中国出土了一双1700年前的三国时期漆木屐而被驳回。这双木屐成为证明木屐源于中国的“铁证”。\n \n 唐代：文化的传播\n唐代木屐工艺精巧华美。日本遣唐使将其带回日本，木屐在异乡落地生根，发展出另一条绵延千年的文化脉络。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "37", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAADh3mXgElyAghVUZZA_CkhQd5kH6f22zjsz04WjmgwNk", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAADh3mXgElyAghVUZZA_CkhQd5kH6f22zjsz04WjmgwNk", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "621530771", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "逍遥啊祥", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_e2559e77db1abd24f763c2783967f070.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7659814736981705529", "create_time": 1783439597, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "日本很多有名的东西都是中国的，日本的抹茶是中国的，宋代时期叫末茶，吃法就跟现在日本的抹茶一样，生鱼片也是中国的，那时候叫脍，脍炙人口就是这么来的", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "30", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAvylnkwP-K305-JyHf2WQETcfcwMI6J4zuyXKoSW5Ov8", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAvylnkwP-K305-JyHf2WQETcfcwMI6J4zuyXKoSW5Ov8", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "bear_0619", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "星✨", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_726d5e0f5f2777694070de7815b5f3bb.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7660214371717481252", "create_time": 1783532646, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "由此可见，造谣造的久了，造的多了，是真的能把假的变成真的[泪奔]他们造谣，说是他们的东西，久了，真有人觉得就是他们的，所以说要仔细甄别呀，不要听别人三言两语，", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "23", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAbz2NQuxZbXKgJIIthNKCgKQn2kgUYxWIh9PX4apIAFLvLsDqju7Of6AtTD8HpfSa", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAbz2NQuxZbXKgJIIthNKCgKQn2kgUYxWIh9PX4apIAFLvLsDqju7Of6AtTD8HpfSa", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "thvvvvvvvvvv9", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "爽歪歪", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_oMieKEIXyDsaAHBYCgfciuACAQEDBA8PA9a1qA.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "1", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7660738616360764179", "create_time": 1783654704, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "我们潮汕80.90的基本都穿过，出花园也要穿，后来慢慢消失了", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "4777", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA2DNNiXpcMwH0ssSOHjGJ9yrStu-cNEDZbyQLLb5fsFg", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA2DNNiXpcMwH0ssSOHjGJ9yrStu-cNEDZbyQLLb5fsFg", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "7203268", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "Jenni ✨", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_0a899de4c46324e11d3efc4cf33b5d08.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "128", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7660085335426597641", "create_time": 1783502600, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "我公公到现在还留着一双这种草窝子", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "2818", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAltdkhUHQhDywNdss-1E61hUCysxkoFfC8Q4bwFF9TqS85PpP8FGWJN9-WIxInj74", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAltdkhUHQhDywNdss-1E61hUCysxkoFfC8Q4bwFF9TqS85PpP8FGWJN9-WIxInj74", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "dy0wtdkl96mb", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "天凉好个秋哇", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/hotsoon-avatar_6560818411159587592.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "76", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7659907793440998196", "create_time": 1783461268, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "樱花是中国的 ，抹茶也是中国的（食贫道有讲），刀叉最早也源于中国", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "254", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAe13K-DYjfptJQVA3kf9a_Oq1ixbG13ZMcWNy9zk1qxo", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAe13K-DYjfptJQVA3kf9a_Oq1ixbG13ZMcWNy9zk1qxo", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "99717199", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "半糖生活捕手", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_90100a26f6c42dee3581ab3e02965eb3.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "13", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7670789339370291994", "create_time": 1785994820, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "“脚著谢公屐，身登青云梯。”原来《梦游天姥吟留别》中说的谢公屐就谢灵运发明的木屐鞋呀，当时只知道穿的是一种鞋，原来历史这么悠久了，嗯长知识了", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "38", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAArxBLJSK0MZYZPzy-tmn2jQJ_4PYCpqSEO1VdurjiwJ8KN6GXjeP7F8nzmqMtKIkR", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAArxBLJSK0MZYZPzy-tmn2jQJ_4PYCpqSEO1VdurjiwJ8KN6GXjeP7F8nzmqMtKIkR", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "xkuasamnn", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "嘻嘻(☆^ー^☆)", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_oMQPDuAsYSBIPIjGlAAE7iqyuAhxLiEZAI8Aa.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "1", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7660270921634825017", "create_time": 1783545813, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "最可悲的不是才知道木屐是中国的，而是日本能够把木屐文化轻易地展现在世人眼前，闹得世界闻名。而咱们的木屐传承人却连生活都成问题，更别说宣传文化了，这样想想，会有多少不知名的文化隐藏在角落不为人知。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "36", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAAYMLsT1UNvWED8acHsZWjQRXYwRrm1nvvuz6ipm4-5x29t8y6SSkZe2d4G3BepT9", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAAYMLsT1UNvWED8acHsZWjQRXYwRrm1nvvuz6ipm4-5x29t8y6SSkZe2d4G3BepT9", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "likexl1920", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "霖的咖啡馆.", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c001_ocVF2lACtACbA9zUACOvwBIgyf9ner7A7NhEAG.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "1", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7659783741497148166", "create_time": 1783432379, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "这个鞋子其实原本是中国的，在魏晋时候就有了，在大唐特别兴盛，日本在唐朝的时候叫做倭国，是我们国家的邦交国，在大唐的时候，日本派遣唐使来我们国家时把这个鞋子带了回去，包括漆器，也是从那个时候传回去了，到现在为止，大家都以为漆器和木屐是日本的，但其实不然是中国的，只是因为中国的文化在清朝的时候断代了，很多东西都没有保留下来，所以大家都很自然的认为，漆器和木屐是日本的文化形象代表。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "460", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA6rCf6tSjlZvNb-ffmkWkWXzdA25D-RQpE28wIZLnJNw", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA6rCf6tSjlZvNb-ffmkWkWXzdA25D-RQpE28wIZLnJNw", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "209947794", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "巳辰", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c001_ogsHALbnCEFJ9DlAfUz3CmaVZChA3DIAeAAbIg.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "12", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7661168062000169791", "create_time": 1783754692, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "不仅仅木屐是中国的，抹茶也是中国的，我之前在一个漫剧里面有很多人骂抹茶，说日本的玩意儿，不是的，我从小就知道抹茶是中国的，且我们中国有抹茶之乡贵州铜仁。能不能别跟没有知识一样，天天骂那些本该属于中国东西，从16年高中开始深入了解历史，算是家乡第一批穿汉服的人（马面裙立领长衫），我就知道木屐是我们中国的，抹茶也是。当然最后也很荣幸有机会去了铜仁了解抹茶之乡。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "925", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAnz1fCFK1Br0-7nMrkfz4Drxk5aaVRaAWWFp45zS9BVSKbVh4XoN0lnaqTwiQ3tH2", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAnz1fCFK1Br0-7nMrkfz4Drxk5aaVRaAWWFp45zS9BVSKbVh4XoN0lnaqTwiQ3tH2", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "0021an", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "清倪", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c001_oAAACLlrVwBWGNsA7eIEjvB3AEIeBHAQsPufIi.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "45", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7660145195447649082", "create_time": 1783516537, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "这玩意我小时候穿的，以前小时候很流行这个，现在没人穿了，坐标广东湛江", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "31620", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAuJy4n1cNUy8vRwcVa09W-uySwsAEbTzhNiUs26cqUgA", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAuJy4n1cNUy8vRwcVa09W-uySwsAEbTzhNiUs26cqUgA", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "64754723", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "好事成双鱼座🐟", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_311e97ddb328d29a02d8265c55b75e4a.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "730", "last_modify_ts": 1794419945545}, {"comment_id": "7660009565731521337", "create_time": 1783484958, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7659759490207730963", "content": "大家还记得李白的“脚著谢公屐,身登青云梯”这句诗吗？", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "1585", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAdeh7v2-2TWXqPP4Un8jOOGcTgCMMpbGogVIVNiuzK3Y", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAdeh7v2-2TWXqPP4Un8jOOGcTgCMMpbGogVIVNiuzK3Y", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "2035394209", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "嫦娥奔月", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/mosai